{"seq":5,"slug":"messaging-and-streaming","title":"消息系统与流处理","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/distributed-systems/messaging-and-streaming","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"message-queue","title":"消息队列模型与选型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/distributed-systems/messaging-and-streaming/message-queue","wordCount":1252,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"kafka-deep-dive","title":"Kafka 深入","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/distributed-systems/messaging-and-streaming/kafka-deep-dive","wordCount":1240,"readingTime":5},{"seq":3,"slug":"event-driven","title":"事件驱动架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/distributed-systems/messaging-and-streaming/event-driven","wordCount":1187,"readingTime":5},{"seq":4,"slug":"stream-processing","title":"流处理框架","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/distributed-systems/messaging-and-streaming/stream-processing","wordCount":1328,"readingTime":6}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"消息系统与流处理-简介\">消息系统与流处理 简介</h1><p>消息系统是分布式架构中实现服务解耦、异步通信和流量削峰的核心基础设施。从传统的消息队列（RabbitMQ）到分布式日志系统（Kafka），再到实时流处理框架（Flink），消息与流处理技术构成了事件驱动架构的基石。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本章内容\">本章内容</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>节</th>\n<th>主题</th>\n<th>核心要点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>01</td>\n<td>消息队列模型与选型</td>\n<td>点对点/发布订阅、可靠投递、选型对比</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>02</td>\n<td>Kafka 深入</td>\n<td>分区模型、ISR、Exactly-Once</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>03</td>\n<td>事件驱动架构</td>\n<td>EDA 模式、事件溯源、CQRS</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>04</td>\n<td>流处理框架</td>\n<td>Flink/Kafka Streams、窗口、状态管理</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"学习路径\">学习路径</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;  A[消息队列基础] --&gt; B[Kafka 深入]&#10;  B --&gt; C[事件驱动架构]&#10;  C --&gt; D[流处理]&#10;  D --&gt; E[实时数据管道]\">graph LR\n  A[消息队列基础] --&gt; B[Kafka 深入]\n  B --&gt; C[事件驱动架构]\n  C --&gt; D[流处理]\n  D --&gt; E[实时数据管道]</pre><h2 id=\"核心观点\">核心观点</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>异步是解耦利器</strong>：消息队列将生产者和消费者在时间和空间上解耦</li>\n<li><strong>消息语义至关重要</strong>：At-Least-Once、At-Most-Once、Exactly-Once 直接影响业务正确性</li>\n<li><strong>事件是一等公民</strong>：事件驱动架构将事件视为系统的核心抽象，而非 RPC 调用</li>\n<li><strong>流处理是实时的批处理</strong>：统一批处理和流处理的编程模型是现代数据架构的趋势</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><ul>\n<li>分布式系统基础（一致性、容错）</li>\n<li>消息通信基本概念（生产者/消费者模式）</li>\n<li>数据库事务基础</li>\n</ul>\n"}